  "description": "Connects the OASIS to GUN via the GUN relay server HTTP API. GUN is a decentralised, real-time, offline-first graph database with peer-to-peer sync. Requires a running GUN relay server (gun npm package). No GUN SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
