  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.GUNOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to GUN via the GUN relay server HTTP API. GUN is a decentralised, real-time, offline-first graph database with peer-to-peer sync. Requires a running GUN relay server (gun npm package). No GUN SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Prepare scoped GUN and OrbitDB native teaching release (c2dbac8)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Other/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.GUNOASIS",
